\v 30 \w After| strong="H310" \w* [him repaired]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w Hananiah| strong="H2608" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Shelemiah| strong="H8018" \w*, \w and Hanun| strong="H2586" \w* \w the sixth| strong="H8345" \w* \w son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Zalaph| strong="H6764" \w*, \w another| strong="H8145" \w* \w piece| strong="H4060" \w*. \w After| strong="H310" \w* [him repaired]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w Meshullam| strong="H4918" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Berechiah| strong="H1296" \w* \w over against his chamber| strong="H5393" \w*. 
\v 31 \w After| strong="H310" \w* [him repaired]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w Malchiah| strong="H4441" \w* [the goldsmith’s]{strong=“H6885”} \w son| strong="H1121" \w* \w unto the place| strong="H1004" \w* \w of the Nethinims| strong="H5411" \w*, [and of the merchants]{strong=“H7402” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w over against the gate| strong="H8179" \w* \w Miphkad| strong="H4663" \w*, \w and to the going up| strong="H5944" \w* \w of the corner| strong="H6438" \w*.\f + \fr 3:31 \ft going…: or, corner chamber \f* 
\v 32 \w And between the going up| strong="H5944" \w* \w of the corner| strong="H6438" \w* \w unto the sheep| strong="H6629" \w* \w gate| strong="H8179" \w* [repaired]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [the goldsmiths]{strong=“H6884” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [and the merchants]{strong=“H7402” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}.\f + \fr 3:32 \ft going…: or, corner chamber \f*
\c 4
\p 
\v 1 [But it came to pass, that when Sanballat]{strong=“H5571”} [heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [that we builded]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the wall| strong="H2346" \w*, [he was wroth]{strong=“H2734” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and took great]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} [indignation]{strong=“H3707” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and mocked]{strong=“H3932” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the Jews| strong="H3064" \w*. 
\v 2 [And he spake]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* \w his brethren| strong="H251" \w* \w and the army| strong="H2428" \w* \w of Samaria| strong="H8111" \w*, [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [What do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w these feeble| strong="H537" \w* \w Jews| strong="H3064" \w*? [will they fortify]{strong=“H5800” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [themselves? will they sacrifice]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}? [will they make an end]{strong=“H3615” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w in a day| strong="H3117" \w*? [will they revive]{strong=“H2421” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the stones| strong="H68" \w* \w out of the heaps| strong="H6194" \w* \w of the rubbish| strong="H6083" \w* [which are burned]{strong=“H8313” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}?\f + \fr 4:2 \ft fortify…: Heb. leave to themselves \f* 
\v 3 \w Now Tobiah| strong="H2900" \w* \w the Ammonite| strong="H5984" \w* was \w by him| strong="H681" \w*, [and he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Even that which they build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w if a fox| strong="H7776" \w* [go up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [he shall even break down]{strong=“H6555” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w their stone| strong="H68" \w* \w wall| strong="H2346" \w*. 
\v 4 [Hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, \w O our God| strong="H430" \w*; \w for we are despised| strong="H939" \w*: [and turn]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} \w their reproach| strong="H2781" \w* \w upon their own head| strong="H7218" \w*, [and give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w them for a prey| strong="H961" \w* \w in the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of captivity| strong="H7633" \w*:\f + \fr 4:4 \ft despised: Heb. despite \f* 
\v 5 [And cover]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w not their iniquity| strong="H5771" \w*, \w and let not their sin| strong="H2403" \w* [be blotted out]{strong=“H4229” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w from before| strong="H6440" \w* thee: for they have provoked thee [to anger]{strong=“H3707” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [before the builders]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
\v 6 [So built]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w we the wall| strong="H2346" \w*; \w and all the wall| strong="H2346" \w* [was joined together]{strong=“H7194” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w unto the half| strong="H2677" \w* [thereof: for the people]{strong=“H5971”} \w had a mind| strong="H3820" \w* [to work]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}. 
\p
\v 7 But it came to pass, that \w when Sanballat| strong="H5571" \w*, \w and Tobiah| strong="H2900" \w*, \w and the Arabians| strong="H6163" \w*, \w and the Ammonites| strong="H5984" \w*, \w and the Ashdodites| strong="H796" \w*, [heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w that the walls| strong="H2346" \w* \w of Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w* [were made up]{strong=“H5927 H724” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, and [that the breaches]{strong=“H6555” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} [began]{strong=“H2490” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [to be stopped]{strong=“H5640” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8736”}, \w then they were very| strong="H3966" \w* [wroth]{strong=“H2734” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \f + \fr 4:7 \ft were made up: Heb. ascended \f* 
\v 8 [And conspired]{strong=“H7194” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w all of them together| strong="H3162" \w* [to come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} and [to fight]{strong=“H3898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8736”} \w against Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*, [and to hinder]{strong=“H8442 H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} it.\f + \fr 4:8 \ft to hinder…: Heb. to make an error to it \f* 
\v 9 [Nevertheless we made our prayer]{strong=“H6419” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} \w unto our God| strong="H430" \w*, [and set]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w a watch| strong="H4929" \w* \w against them day| strong="H3119" \w* \w and night| strong="H3915" \w*, \w because| strong="H6440" \w* of them. 
\v 10 \w And Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w The strength| strong="H3581" \w* \w of the bearers of burdens| strong="H5449" \w* [is decayed]{strong=“H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, and there is [much]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w rubbish| strong="H6083" \w*; [so that we are not able]{strong=“H3201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w the wall| strong="H2346" \w*. 
\v 11 \w And our adversaries| strong="H6862" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [They shall not know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [neither see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [till we come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in the midst| strong="H8432" \w* \w among| strong="H8432" \w* [them, and slay]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [them, and cause the work]{strong=“H4399”} [to cease]{strong=“H7673” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}. 
\v 12 [And it came to pass, that when the Jews]{strong=“H3064”} [which dwelt]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w by them| strong="H681" \w* [came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [they said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto us ten| strong="H6235" \w* \w times| strong="H6471" \w*, \w From all places| strong="H4725" \w* [whence ye shall return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto us they will be upon you.\f + \fr 4:12 \ft From all…: or, That from all places ye must return to us \f* 
\p
\v 13 [Therefore set]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w I in the lower| strong="H8482" \w* \w places| strong="H4725" \w* \w behind| strong="H310" \w* \w the wall| strong="H2346" \w*, and [on the higher places]{strong=“H6708 H6706” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8675”}, [I even set]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the people| strong="H5971" \w* \w after their families| strong="H4940" \w* \w with their swords| strong="H2719" \w*, \w their spears| strong="H7420" \w*, \w and their bows| strong="H7198" \w*.\f + \fr 4:13 \ft in the…: Heb. from the lower parts of the place, etc \f* 
\v 14 [And I looked]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and rose up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the nobles| strong="H2715" \w*, \w and to the rulers| strong="H5461" \w*, \w and to the rest| strong="H3499" \w* \w of the people| strong="H5971" \w*, [Be not ye afraid]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w of them| strong="H6440" \w*: [remember ]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w the Lord| strong="H136" \w*, which is \w great| strong="H1419" \w* [and terrible]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}, [and fight]{strong=“H3898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8734”} \w for your brethren| strong="H251" \w*, \w your sons| strong="H1121" \w*, \w and your daughters| strong="H1323" \w*, \w your wives| strong="H802" \w*, \w and your houses| strong="H1004" \w*. 
\v 15 [And it came to pass, when our enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [that it was known]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [unto us, and God]{strong=“H430”} \w had brought| strong="H6565" \w* \w their counsel| strong="H6098" \w* [to nought]{strong=“H6565” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [that we returned]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w all of us to the wall| strong="H2346" \w*, \w every one| strong="H376" \w* \w unto his work| strong="H4399" \w*. 
\p
\v 16 \w And it came to pass from that time| strong="H3117" \w* forth, that \w the half| strong="H2677" \w* \w of my servants| strong="H5288" \w* [wrought]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in the work| strong="H4399" \w*, \w and the other half| strong="H2677" \w* [of them held]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w both the spears| strong="H7420" \w*, \w the shields| strong="H4043" \w*, \w and the bows| strong="H7198" \w*, \w and the habergeons| strong="H8302" \w*; \w and the rulers| strong="H8269" \w* were \w behind| strong="H310" \w* \w all the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*. 
\v 17 [They which builded]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w on the wall| strong="H2346" \w*, [and they that bare]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w burdens| strong="H5447" \w*, [with those that laded]{strong=“H6006” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, every one \w with one| strong="H259" \w* \w of his hands| strong="H3027" \w* [wrought]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in the work| strong="H4399" \w*, \w and with the other| strong="H259" \w* hand [held]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w a weapon| strong="H7973" \w*. 
\v 18 [For the builders]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w every one| strong="H376" \w* \w had his sword| strong="H2719" \w* [girded]{strong=“H631” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w by his side| strong="H4975" \w*, and so [builded]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. [And he that sounded]{strong=“H8628” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the trumpet| strong="H7782" \w* was \w by me| strong="H681" \w*.\f + \fr 4:18 \ft by his side: Heb. on his loins \f* 
\p
\v 19 [And I said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the nobles| strong="H2715" \w*, \w and to the rulers| strong="H5461" \w*, \w and to the rest| strong="H3499" \w* \w of the people| strong="H5971" \w*, \w The work| strong="H4399" \w* is [great]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w and large| strong="H7342" \w*, [and we are separated]{strong=“H6504” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w upon the wall| strong="H2346" \w*, \w one| strong="H376" \w* \w far from| strong="H7350" \w* \w another| strong="H251" \w*. 
\v 20 \w In what place| strong="H4725" \w* therefore [ye hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the sound| strong="H6963" \w* \w of the trumpet| strong="H7782" \w*, [resort]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} [ye thither unto us: our God]{strong=“H430”} [shall fight]{strong=“H3898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} for us. 
\v 21 [So we laboured]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in the work| strong="H4399" \w*: \w and half| strong="H2677" \w* [of them held]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w the spears| strong="H7420" \w* [from the rising]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w of the morning| strong="H7837" \w* \w till the stars| strong="H3556" \w* [appeared]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}. 
\v 22 \w Likewise at the same time| strong="H6256" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w I unto the people| strong="H5971" \w*, \w Let every one| strong="H376" \w* \w with his servant| strong="H5288" \w* [lodge ]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w within| strong="H8432" \w* \w Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*, \w that in the night| strong="H3915" \w* \w they may be a guard| strong="H4929" \w* [to us, and labour]{strong=“H4399”} \w on the day| strong="H3117" \w*. 
\v 23 [So neither I, nor my brethren]{strong=“H251”}, \w nor my servants| strong="H5288" \w*, \w nor the men| strong="H582" \w* \w of the guard| strong="H4929" \w* \w which followed| strong="H310" \w* [me, none of us]{strong=“H587”} [put off]{strong=“H6584” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w our clothes| strong="H899" \w*, saving that \w every one| strong="H376" \w* \w put them off| strong="H7973" \w* \w for washing| strong="H4325" \w*.\f + \fr 4:23 \ft saving…: or, every one went with his weapon for water \f*
\c 5
\p 
\v 1 \w And there was a great| strong="H1419" \w* \w cry| strong="H6818" \w* \w of the people| strong="H5971" \w* \w and of their wives| strong="H802" \w* \w against their brethren| strong="H251" \w* \w the Jews| strong="H3064" \w*. 
\v 2 \w For there were| strong="H3426" \w* [that said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [We, our sons]{strong=“H1121”}, \w and our daughters| strong="H1323" \w*, are \w many| strong="H7227" \w*: [therefore we take up]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w corn| strong="H1715" \w* for them, [that we may eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and live]{strong=“H2421” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 3 Some \w also there were| strong="H3426" \w* [that said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [We have mortgaged]{strong=“H6148” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w our lands| strong="H7704" \w*, \w vineyards| strong="H3754" \w*, \w and houses| strong="H1004" \w*, [that we might buy]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w corn| strong="H1715" \w*, \w because of the dearth| strong="H7458" \w*. 
\v 4 \w There were| strong="H3426" \w* [also that said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [We have borrowed]{strong=“H3867” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w money| strong="H3701" \w* [for the king’s]{strong=“H4428”} \w tribute| strong="H4060" \w*, and that upon \w our lands| strong="H7704" \w* \w and vineyards| strong="H3754" \w*. 
\v 5 \w Yet now our flesh| strong="H1320" \w* is \w as the flesh| strong="H1320" \w* \w of our brethren| strong="H251" \w*, \w our children| strong="H1121" \w* \w as their children| strong="H1121" \w*: [and, lo, we bring into bondage]{strong=“H3533” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w our sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w and our daughters| strong="H1323" \w* \w to be servants| strong="H5650" \w*, and some \w of our daughters| strong="H1323" \w* \w are| strong="H3426" \w* [brought unto bondage]{strong=“H3533” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} already: neither is it [in our power]{strong=“H3027 H410”} to redeem them; \w for other men| strong="H312" \w* \w have our lands| strong="H7704" \w* \w and vineyards| strong="H3754" \w*. 
\p
\v 6 \w And I was very| strong="H3966" \w* [angry]{strong=“H2734” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [when I heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w their cry| strong="H2201" \w* \w and these words| strong="H1697" \w*. 
\v 7 [Then I consulted]{strong=“H4427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w with myself| strong="H3820" \w*, [and I rebuked]{strong=“H7378” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the nobles| strong="H2715" \w*, \w and the rulers| strong="H5461" \w*, [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto them, Ye exact]{strong=“H5375 H5383 H5378” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8675 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8678 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} \w usury| strong="H4855" \w*, \w every one| strong="H376" \w* \w of his brother| strong="H251" \w*. [And I set]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a great| strong="H1419" \w* \w assembly| strong="H6952" \w* against them.\f + \fr 5:7 \ft I consulted…: Heb. my heart consulted in me \f* 
\v 8 [And I said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto them, We after our ability]{strong=“H1767”} [have redeemed]{strong=“H7069” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w our brethren| strong="H251" \w* \w the Jews| strong="H3064" \w*, [which were sold]{strong=“H4376” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w unto the heathen| strong="H1471" \w*; [and will ye even sell]{strong=“H4376” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w your brethren| strong="H251" \w*? [or shall they be sold]{strong=“H4376” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [unto us? Then held they their peace]{strong=“H2790” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [and found]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w nothing| strong="H1697" \w* to answer. 
\v 9 [Also I said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, It is \w not good| strong="H2896" \w* \w that| strong="H1697" \w* [ye do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}: [ought ye not to walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in the fear| strong="H3374" \w* \w of our God| strong="H430" \w* \w because of the reproach| strong="H2781" \w* \w of the heathen| strong="H1471" \w* [our enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}? 
\v 10 I likewise, and \w my brethren| strong="H251" \w*, \w and my servants| strong="H5288" \w*, [might exact]{strong=“H5383” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of them money| strong="H3701" \w* \w and corn| strong="H1715" \w*: [I pray you, let us leave off]{strong=“H5800” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w this usury| strong="H4855" \w*. 
\v 11 [Restore]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”}, [I pray you, to them, even this day]{strong=“H3117”}, \w their lands| strong="H7704" \w*, \w their vineyards| strong="H3754" \w*, \w their oliveyards| strong="H2132" \w*, \w and their houses| strong="H1004" \w*, \w also the hundredth| strong="H3967" \w* part \w of the money| strong="H3701" \w*, \w and of the corn| strong="H1715" \w*, \w the wine| strong="H8492" \w*, \w and the oil| strong="H3323" \w*, [that ye exact]{strong=“H5383” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} of them. 
\v 12 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [they, We will restore]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} them, [and will require]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [nothing of them; so will we do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [as thou sayest]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. [Then I called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the priests| strong="H3548" \w*, [and took an oath]{strong=“H7650” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [of them, that they should do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w according to this promise| strong="H1697" \w*. 
\v 13 [Also I shook]{strong=“H5287” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w my lap| strong="H2684" \w*, [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w So God| strong="H430" \w* [shake out]{strong=“H5287” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w every man| strong="H376" \w* \w from his house| strong="H1004" \w*, \w and from his labour| strong="H3018" \w*, [that performeth]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w not this promise| strong="H1697" \w*, [even thus be he shaken out]{strong=“H5287” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}, \w and emptied| strong="H7386" \w*. \w And all the congregation| strong="H6951" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w Amen| strong="H543" \w*, [and praised]{strong=“H1984” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} the \sc Lord\sc*. \w And the people| strong="H5971" \w* [did]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w according to this promise| strong="H1697" \w*.\f + \fr 5:13 \ft emptied: Heb. empty, or, void \f* 
\p
\v 14 \w Moreover from the time| strong="H3117" \w* [that I was appointed]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w to be their governor| strong="H6346" \w* \w in the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, \w from the twentieth| strong="H6242" \w* \w year| strong="H8141" \w* \w even unto the two| strong="H8147" \w* \w and thirtieth| strong="H7970" \w* \w year| strong="H8141" \w* \w of Artaxerxes| strong="H783" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w*, that is, [twelve]{strong=“H6240 H8147”} \w years| strong="H8141" \w*, \w I and my brethren| strong="H251" \w* [have not eaten]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the bread| strong="H3899" \w* \w of the governor| strong="H6346" \w*. 
\v 15 \w But the former| strong="H7223" \w* \w governors| strong="H6346" \w* that had been \w before| strong="H6440" \w* [me were chargeable]{strong=“H3513” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w unto the people| strong="H5971" \w*, [and had taken]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w of them bread| strong="H3899" \w* \w and wine| strong="H3196" \w*, \w beside| strong="H310" \w* \w forty| strong="H705" \w* \w shekels| strong="H8255" \w* \w of silver| strong="H3701" \w*; [yea, even]{strong=“H1571”} \w their servants| strong="H5288" \w* [bare rule]{strong=“H7980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w over the people| strong="H5971" \w*: [but so did]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not I, because]{strong=“H6440”} \w of the fear| strong="H3374" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w*. 
\v 16 [Yea, also I continued]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w in the work| strong="H4399" \w* \w of this wall| strong="H2346" \w*, [neither bought]{strong=“H7069” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w we any land| strong="H7704" \w*: \w and all my servants| strong="H5288" \w* were [gathered]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w thither unto the work| strong="H4399" \w*. 
\v 17 Moreover there were \w at my table| strong="H7979" \w* \w an hundred| strong="H3967" \w* [and fifty]{strong=“H376 H2572”} \w of the Jews| strong="H3064" \w* \w and rulers| strong="H5461" \w*, [beside those that came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w unto us from among the heathen| strong="H1471" \w* that are \w about us| strong="H5439" \w*. 
\v 18 Now that [which was prepared]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} for me \w daily| strong="H3117" \w* was \w one| strong="H259" \w* \w ox| strong="H7794" \w* and \w six| strong="H8337" \w* [choice]{strong=“H1305” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w sheep| strong="H6629" \w*; \w also fowls| strong="H6833" \w* [were prepared]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [for me, and once in ten]{strong=“H6235”} \w days| strong="H3117" \w* [store]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w of all sorts of wine| strong="H3196" \w*: \w yet for all| strong="H5973" \w* [this required]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w not I the bread| strong="H3899" \w* \w of the governor| strong="H6346" \w*, \w because the bondage| strong="H5656" \w* [was heavy]{strong=“H3513” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w upon this people| strong="H5971" \w*. 
\v 19 [Think]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [upon me, my God]{strong=“H430”}, \w for good| strong="H2896" \w*, according [to all that I have done]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w for this people| strong="H5971" \w*. 
\c 6
\p 
\v 1 [Now it came to pass, when Sanballat]{strong=“H5571”}, \w and Tobiah| strong="H2900" \w*, \w and Geshem| strong="H1654" \w* \w the Arabian| strong="H6163" \w*, \w and the rest| strong="H3499" \w* [of our enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [that I had builded]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the wall| strong="H2346" \w*, and that \w there was no breach| strong="H6556" \w* [left]{strong=“H3498” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [therein; (though]{strong=“H5704 H1571”} \w at that time| strong="H6256" \w* [I had not set up]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the doors| strong="H1817" \w* \w upon the gates| strong="H8179" \w*;) 
\v 2 \w That Sanballat| strong="H5571" \w* \w and Geshem| strong="H1654" \w* [sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto me, saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [Come]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [let us meet]{strong=“H3259” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w together| strong="H3162" \w* in some one of \w the villages| strong="H3715" \w* \w in the plain| strong="H1237" \w* \w of Ono| strong="H207" \w*. [But they thought]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [to do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w me mischief| strong="H7451" \w*. 
\v 3 [And I sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w messengers| strong="H4397" \w* [unto them, saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, I am [doing]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w a great| strong="H1419" \w* \w work| strong="H4399" \w*, [so that I cannot]{strong=“H3201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [come down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}: \w why should the work| strong="H4399" \w* [cease]{strong=“H7673” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w whilst| strong="H834" \w* [I leave]{strong=“H7503” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [it, and come down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} to you? 
\v 4 [Yet they sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto me four| strong="H702" \w* \w times| strong="H6471" \w* \w after this sort| strong="H1697" \w*; [and I answered]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w them after the same manner| strong="H1697" \w*. 
\v 5 [Then sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Sanballat| strong="H5571" \w* \w his servant| strong="H5288" \w* \w unto me in like manner| strong="H1697" \w* \w the fifth| strong="H2549" \w* \w time| strong="H6471" \w* [with an open]{strong=“H6605” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w letter| strong="H107" \w* \w in his hand| strong="H3027" \w*; 
\v 6 Wherein was [written]{strong=“H3789” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}, [It is reported]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w among the heathen| strong="H1471" \w*, \w and Gashmu| strong="H1654" \w* [saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} it, that \w thou and the Jews| strong="H3064" \w* [think]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [to rebel]{strong=“H4775” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}: \w for which cause| strong="H3651" \w* [thou buildest]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the wall| strong="H2346" \w*, [that thou mayest be]{strong=“H1933” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w their king| strong="H4428" \w*, \w according to these words| strong="H1697" \w*.\f + \fr 6:6 \ft Gashmu: also called, Geshem \f* 
\v 7 [And thou hast also appointed]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w prophets| strong="H5030" \w* [to preach]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w of thee at Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, There is \w a king| strong="H4428" \w* \w in Judah| strong="H3063" \w*: [and now shall it be reported]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w to the king| strong="H4428" \w* \w according to these words| strong="H1697" \w*. [Come]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [now therefore, and let us take counsel]{strong=“H3289” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w together| strong="H3162" \w*. 
\v 8 [Then I sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w There are| strong="H1961" \w* \w no such things| strong="H1697" \w* [done]{strong=“H1961” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [as thou sayest]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [but thou feignest]{strong=“H908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w them out of thine own heart| strong="H3820" \w*. 
\v 9 [For they all made us afraid]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w Their hands| strong="H3027" \w* [shall be weakened]{strong=“H7503” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w from the work| strong="H4399" \w*, [that it be not done]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}. Now therefore, O God, [strengthen]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} \w my hands| strong="H3027" \w*. 
\p
\v 10 [Afterward I came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Shemaiah| strong="H8098" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Delaiah| strong="H1806" \w* \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Mehetabeel| strong="H4105" \w*, who was [shut up]{strong=“H6113” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}; [and he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Let us meet together]{strong=“H3259” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w in the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w*, \w within| strong="H8432" \w* \w the temple| strong="H1964" \w*, [and let us shut]{strong=“H5462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the doors| strong="H1817" \w* \w of the temple| strong="H1964" \w*: [for they will come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [to slay]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [thee; yea, in the night]{strong=“H3915”} [will they come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [to slay]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} thee. 
\v 11 [And I said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w Should such| strong="H3644" \w* \w a man| strong="H376" \w* [as I flee]{strong=“H1272” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}? and who is there, that, being as I am, [would go]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into the temple| strong="H1964" \w* [to save his life]{strong=“H2425” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}? [I will not go in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 12 [And, lo, I perceived]{strong=“H5234” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w that God| strong="H430" \w* [had not sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [him; but that he pronounced]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w this prophecy| strong="H5016" \w* [against me: for Tobiah]{strong=“H2900”} \w and Sanballat| strong="H5571" \w* [had hired]{strong=“H7936” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} him. 
\v 13 Therefore was [he hired]{strong=“H7936” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}, [that I should be afraid]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and do so]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and sin]{strong=“H2398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, and that they might have matter \w for an evil| strong="H7451" \w* \w report| strong="H8034" \w*, [that they might reproach]{strong=“H2778” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} me. 
\v 14 \w My God| strong="H430" \w*, [think]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thou upon Tobiah| strong="H2900" \w* \w and Sanballat| strong="H5571" \w* \w according to these their works| strong="H4639" \w*, \w and on the prophetess| strong="H5031" \w* \w Noadiah| strong="H5129" \w*, \w and the rest| strong="H3499" \w* \w of the prophets| strong="H5030" \w*, [that would have put me in fear]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}. 
\p
\v 15 \w So the wall| strong="H2346" \w* [was finished]{strong=“H7999” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in the twenty| strong="H6242" \w* \w and fifth| strong="H2568" \w* day of the month \w Elul| strong="H435" \w*, \w in fifty| strong="H2572" \w* \w and two| strong="H8147" \w* \w days| strong="H3117" \w*. 
\v 16 [And it came to pass, that when all our enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} thereof, \w and all the heathen| strong="H1471" \w* that were \w about us| strong="H5439" \w* [saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} these things, \w they were much| strong="H3966" \w* [cast down]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in their own eyes| strong="H5869" \w*: [for they perceived]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w that this work| strong="H4399" \w* [was wrought]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w of our God| strong="H430" \w*. 
\p
\v 17 \w Moreover in those days| strong="H3117" \w* \w the nobles| strong="H2715" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w* [sent]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [many]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w letters| strong="H107" \w* \w unto Tobiah| strong="H2900" \w*, and the letters \w of Tobiah| strong="H2900" \w* [came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} unto them.\f + \fr 6:17 \ft sent…: Heb. multiplied their letters passing to Tobiah \f* 
